  "description": "Optional add-on for League of Legends Heroes: Syndra's Force of Will as in League - with no Dark Sphere counted on her, she lifts the nearest minion or monster (never the dragons, a champion or a tower) and throws it at her target. The data pack cannot pick only minions and monsters nor move a unit to a point, so there W always throws a sphere conjured in her hand; this add-on lifts the unit, holds it before her and flies it onto the target while the data deals the throw's damage and slow. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
  "last_updated": "2026-10-11",
  "mod_id": "league_syndra",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "name": "League Heroes: Syndra lifts minions and monsters",
  "version": "0.1.0"
}
